AAYE QATIL-E-KARBALA &ndash; YA HUSSAIN YA HUSSAIN<br>
AAYE GHAREEB-E-NAINAWA &ndash; YA HUSSAIN YA HUSSAIN<br>
Ya Hussain Ibne Ali Assalam Assalam<br>
Sibte Paighambar Ya Hussain Ya Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
Dilbar-e-Hyder Ya Hussain Ya Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
<br>
1.Roze Aanshoor Luta Asr Talak Ghar Tera<br>
Koi Bakhi Na Raha Tujhku Bachane Wala<br>
Haaye Pamal Howa Dasht Me Tera Laasha<br>
Aaye Qatil-e-Karbala Ya Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
Aaye Ghareeb-e-Nainawa Ya Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
<br>
2.Haq Pe Qurban Howe Aun-o-Mohd Run Me<br>
Chur Zakhmou Se Karbobala Ke Bun Me<br>
Kaisi Yeh Aag Laagi Shah Tere Gulshan Me<br>
Aaye Qateel-e-Karbala Ya Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
Aaye Ghareeb-e-Nainawa Ya Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
<br>
3.Haaye Aathara Baras Maa Ne Jisse Tha Pala<br>
Khake Seene Pe Seena Khoon Ka Dariya Ubla<br>
Haal par Tere Taras Koi Na Khaya Moula<br>
Aaye Qatil-e-Karbala Ya Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
Aaye Ghareeb-e-Nainawa Ya Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
<br>
4.Haaye Masoom Gala Teer-e-Sitam Waiwala<br>
Usku Ek Boond Bhi Paani Ka Na Ummat Ne Diye<br>
Uska Dum Todhna Hathou Pe Jo Tumne Dekha<br>
Aaye Qatil-e-Karbala Ya Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
Aaye Ghareeb-e-Nainawa Ya Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
<br>
5.Pouhche Jab Laash Pe Qasim Ki Tha Khoon Ka Manzar<br>
Run Me Pamal Tha Bikhra Howa Farwa Ka Pisar<br>
Tukhde Qasim Ke Uthana Wo Tera Roro Kar<br>
Aaye Qatil-e-Karbala Ya Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
Aaye Ghareeb-e-Nainawa Ya Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
<br>
6.Bafawa Sher-e-jaari Pouhcha Jo Paani Ke LIye<br>
Laota Jis Waqt Laaga Gurz-e-Sitam Baazu Kaate<br>
Haan Palatna Wo Tera Mashk-o-Alam Saath Liye<br>
Aaye Qatil-e-Karbala Ya Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
Aaye Ghareeb-e-Nainawa Ya Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
<br>
7.Aayi Hai Teri Behan Laut Ke Chehlum Ke Liye<br>
Mere Maajaye Wafa Karke Main Aayi Wade<br>
Saath Soughat-e-Safar Neel Hai Baazu Pa Mera<br>
Aaye Qatil-e-Karbala Ya Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
Aaye Ghareeb-e-Nainawa Ya Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
<br>
8.Jayungi Maa Ki Halat Par Tera Kurta Lekar<br>
Maa Ki Turbat Se Kahungi Hai Saughat-e-Safar<br>
Dastan Saari Sonaungi Wahi Roro Kar<br>
Aaye Qatil-e-Karbala Ya Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
Aaye Ghareeb-e-Nainawa Ya Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
<br>
9.Sheh Ka Khat Padhke Habeeb Ibne Mazahir Jo Chale<br>
Ek Ek Lafz Pe Wo Aansu Bahate Hi Rahe<br>
Aise Ansar Khudawand Ne Tumku Bakhse<br>
Aaye Qatil-e-Karbala Ya Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
Aaye Ghareeb-e-Nainawa Ya Hussain Ya Hussain
